title: Awning
text: Keep the rain off the two dark stones. Coloured glass only lets light through its faces; from the edge it is a wall.
trick: each filter does two jobs: it colours the level beam passing through its faces and stops the falling beam that hits its edge
motif: two rain streaks stopped by an awning
expect: recolours>=2, black>=2
